<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures cut gains late, end down.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures cut gains late, end down.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 20 - Most U.S. stock index futures cut their gains late and turned down to finish mostly lower. Traders said locals turned seller in Sept S&amp;P 500, along with one dealer who sold 150. Light trade, illiquid pits contributed to swift decline, traders said.</p>
